# Force LF line endings in the repository regardless of contributor OS/git
# config. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true silently
# rewrites the *.json data files to CRLF; scripts that hash local disk
# content (e.g. data/build_release_manifest.py) then bake wrong byte
# counts/hashes into the committed manifest, breaking release validation
# in Linux CI where files check out as LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
